2028 # endyr_proj: Projection end year, must be later than assessment endyr
2025 # styr_regs: New management start year, must be later than assessment endyr
3 # Fproj_switch: Value to use for Fproj: 1=current F, 2=Fmsy, 3=F30, 4=F40, 5=F50, 6=Fproxy
0 # Fproj_mult: Multiplier "c" applied to compute projection F, for example Fproj=cFmsy
3 # Rproj_switch: Value to use for projected recruitment: 1=mean-unbiased spawner recruit curve, 2=mean recruitment defined for SPR calcs (rec_mean), 3=mean recruitment from end of assessment (rec_mu)

